              is in representables, which are maximally compact, the stament follows with prop.
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CompactnessOfColimitsOverCompacts"}
          #CellularModel.num_defn
            %h6#definition_15 Definition
            %p
              A
              %strong
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cellular+model"} cellular model
              on
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
