                    Monos = LLP(RLP(I))
                    \\,.
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#Cisinski06"}> Cisinski 06, def. 1.2.26
            ).
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_6 Remark
            %p
              By prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PresheavesAreCompact"}
              we may apply the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/small+object+argument"} small object argument
              in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi PSh
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi A
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} PSh(A)
              and so it follows that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi LLP
