                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C \subset Mor(PSh(A))
              be a class of morphisms, and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi D
                    %mo ⊂
                    %mi PSh
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi A
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D \subset PSh(A)
              a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/small+set"} small set
              of objects, such that
            %ol
              %li
                %p
