              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi p
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p
              is an acyclic fibration. By lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#NaiveFibAndDualStrongDefRetractIsAcyclFib"}
              it is sufficient to show that it is a dual strong deformation retract.
            %p
              By lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#WeakEquivalencesBetweenFibrantObjects"}
